+## GLM chunked KDA prompt kernel, prompt grid and prompt replay
+
+`families/glm5_next/cuda/kda_chunk.cu` and `kda_chunk.cpp` (the recipe's files, with a two-line credit header),
+`kda_chunked.py` (the recipe's torch references `prep_reference`, `recurrent_reference`, `chunked_reference`,
+`gate_norm_reference` and `chain_reference`, and `chain`, which runs the CUDA kernel), `kda.py`'s `CHUNKED` and
+`chain(..., pos=)`, `engine.py`'s `kda_chunked_on`, `GRIDS`, `prompt_grid` and `grid_point`, and the prompt-grid and
+prompt-replay paths of `decode.py` (`Snapshot.head`, `whole`, `prefill`'s replay and grid check), `engine.py`
+(`GlmEngine._resume` / `_run_once`, the startup lines) and `multi.py` (`Lane.head`, `fill_rows`' grid,
+`MultiDecoder._resume` / `_keep` / `_fill`, the replay in `_admitted`) are ported from MiaAI-Lab's
+[GLM-5.3-Flash EXL3 2x DGX Spark recipe](https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks-TensorFold/tree/1576746)
+patches 0012-glm-kda-chunked, 0014-glm-kda-chunked-gb10 and 0039-glm-kda-chunked-kernel (their end state: 0039's
+CUDA kernel replaces the earlier Triton versions), 0008-glm-prompt-grid and 0042-glm-prompt-replay, Apache License
+2.0, Copyright 2026 MiaAI-Lab (see [the license text](LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt)). Changes in the port: `kda_chunked.py`
+drops a first, shadowed definition of `chain_reference` (the recipe file defines it twice; the second one is the one
+Python keeps, and it is taken verbatim); prompt chunks pass their position to `kda.chain` only under
+`TF_GLM_KDA_CHUNKED=1` (`kda.prompt_kw`), so without it the serial kernels' calls are the ones before; this tree keeps
+its kept-cut path inside a prompt chunk, which gets the rows' positions too; without a prompt grid a drafted prompt
+keeps its state before its last token as before (`multi.keep_point`), and only with `TF_GLM_PROMPT_GRID` (64 under
+`TF_GLM_KDA_CHUNKED=1`) at the recipe's grid point, an on-grid prompt's end state keeping its head's logits row for
+a replay; MTP streams replay too (the kept last hidden row waits for the first token); multi-prompt chunks
+(`TF_GLM_MULTI_PREFILL`) leave replays out. `TF_GLM_KDA_CHUNKED` and `TF_GLM_PROMPT_GRID` are off unless set (the
+recipe's `config.sh` sets `KDA_CHUNKED=1`).
